\section{Experiments}
\label{sec:experiments}
    In experiments, we evaluate our proposed algorithm on MPE and SMAC tasks designed by~\cite{wang2025n}, compared with the only baseline algorithm POAM for NAHT. Also, we demonstrate the importance of basis games, a core concept in our theory, as an aid to setting the number of components considered in TTD($\lambda$). All experimental results are run with 5 random seeds and demonstrated in means with 95\% confidence intervals. The details of baselines, the implementation of our algorithm and further experimental settings are given in \textcolor{black}{Appendix~\ref{sec:experimental-details}}.
