%  =& (\sum_{i \in \N \setminus \{n, n+1, n+2\}} \frac{r_{i}}{2^{i}}) + \frac{r_{n} + \lambda}{2^{n}} + \frac{r_{n+1}}{2^{n+1}} + \frac{r_{n+2} + 2 \lambda}{2^{n+2}}  \\
