\SETCORE contains 27,233 theorems.\footnote{We exclude the syntactic ``theorems'' with
typecode \mmname{wff}: \mmname{weq}, \mmname{wel}, \mmname{bj-0}, \mmname{sn-wcdeq}.} Its $\base$
component represents the axioms in the considered part of \setmm, $\clauses$
