%         The conclusion in Theorem~\ref{theorem:strict local optima} does not necessarily extend to settings beyond tabular TSGs. For instance, straightforward counterexamples can be constructed in continuous games using quadratic functions  \citep{mazumdar2020gradient}.
% \end{remark}



