In this section, we present two sets of experiments to validate the effectiveness of our algorithms. In the first set, the MV-MAPI algorithm is tested in two specific scenarios where the environmental model is known (referred to as model-based scenarios). We analyze the impacts of different update orders and initial policies on the algorithm's performance. In the second set, the MV-MATRPO algorithm is applied to two scenarios where the environmental models are unknown (referred to as model-free scenarios). One scenario replicates the settings from the first set, while the other involves a significantly larger-scale scenario. All experiments were conducted on a machine equipped with an AMD 3995WX CPU, 256 GB of memory, and an Nvidia GeForce GTX 4090 GPU.

