\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=*]
\item For each type $t$ from $\mathcal{H}_o$, we match it with a type that is from $\mathcal{H}_{gt}$ and is the most frequent entity type annotation of the associated tables of $t$. This matched type is denoted as $m(t)$. 
