\item We calculate the consistency of each type $t$ from $\mathcal{H}_o$ as 
\begin{equation}
    C_{type}(t) = \frac{|\left\{a \in A(t, \mathcal{H}_o) | m(a) \in   A(m(t), \mathcal{H}_{gt}) \right\}  |}{|A(t, \mathcal{H}_o)|}
\end{equation}
