\item The TCS score of $\mathcal{H}_o$ is computed as
\begin{equation}
    C_{taxo}(\mathcal{H}_o) = \frac{\sum_{t \in \mathcal{T}_o} C_{type}(t)}{|\mathcal{T}_o|}
\end{equation}
where $\mathcal{T}_o$ is all the types of $\mathcal{H}_o$.
