\subsection{Experimental Settings}

The models are optimized using the Adam optimizer~\cite{DBLP:journals/corr/KingmaB14} with an initial learning rate of \(1 \times 10^{-3}\). To ensure a rigorous evaluation, we measure four classification metrics: Accuracy, F1-score, Precision, and Recall. All experiments are conducted on an NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti GPU with a batch size of 128 for 30 epochs. The cross-entropy loss function is minimized during training.
