\section{Conclusion}

In this paper, we conduct an empirical analysis for fake news video categorization and construct a novel fake news video dataset (FMNV) using large model-based data augmentation. We provide a comprehensive description of FMNV's creation process with in-depth investigations into data entity attributes and distribution characteris-tics. To assess the dataset's validity, we introduce a new baseline model FMNVD and perform numerical experiments to evaluate various baseline performances, thereby demonstrating FMNV's generalization capability. Future work will explore additional promising approaches to enhance the dataset's predictive power, with the expectation that FMNV will pave the way for advanced developments in MFND research.


