Let $(\Gen_H, \Gen_B, \DualCom)$ be a dual-mode commitment scheme.
Let $(\Gen, \Com)$ be a perfectly binding, computationally hiding commitment scheme.
Let $\Pi$ be an $n$-party, perfectly correct, perfectly $t$-private, perfectly $t$-robust MPC protocol. Let $\cR$ be an $\NP$ relation.


