    \item Apply $Z^{b_{\beta_i}'}X^{a_{\beta_i}'}$ to the $\beta_i^{th}$ qubit in $\ket{\psi_{hist}}$ for all $i \in [2]$ to get a resulting state $\ket{\psi_{hist}'}$.
The check in \cref{sec:history} with respect to the previously chosen measurement $S$ passes for $\ket{\psi_{hist}'}$ at indices $\{\beta_i\}_{i \in [2]}$.
\end{itemize}
Else, output $0$.

