\textbf{Finding the Best Sentiment Analysis Technique for HN:}
We investigated many state-of-the-art sentiment analysis techniques in the literature for this task. In order to find the best-performing technique for our dataset, we compared them using our manually labeled sentiment ground truth following the suggestions of the work of Lin et al. \cite{Lin2018}, where they warned that researchers should not assume the sentiment analysis tool provides a reliable result off-the-shelf. 
