			$ of cardinality $\frac{\Lambda-t_a}{t_p+1}=\frac{r}{t_p}$. For each $P_i$, define $Q_i=[\Lambda]\setminus\{S\cup P_i\}$. Note that $|Q_i|=\Lambda-t_a-\frac{\Lambda-t_a}{t_p+1}=\frac{(\Lambda-t_a)t_p}{t_p+1}=r.$ Since the sets $Q_{i,i\in[t_p+1]}$ are sets of cardinality $r$, they serve as placeholders for the user-index set ${U}$ and the mini-subfile-index sets ${T}_{i,i\in[t_p]}$. 

