	\section{Achievability Scheme and Lower Bound}
	\label{achievabilitysection}
In this section, we first describe the placement and delivery scheme that achieves the rate stated in Theorem~\ref{intersectionclassrate}. We then present the proofs of Claim~\ref{uniformintersectionclaim} and Corollary~\ref{uniformintersectionrate}. Finally, we provide the proof of Theorem~\ref{alphaboundrate}.
