% The full list of failed compilation cases includes: \textbf{2, 3, 4, 11, 19, 26, 39, 45, 49, 51, 61, 71, 73, 76, 79, 82, 85, 95, 96, 105}. These failures highlight the baseline’s vulnerability to clause mismanagement, syntax errors, and limited support for modern C++ idioms.

