To evaluate the effectiveness of persiansort and juxtapose this approach with other methods, we designated the wp value as 9, acknowledging that the optimal wp may vary and superior results may be achieved with different amount of wp. To evaluate the efficacy of this method and juxtapose it with alternative methods, we employ the same technique utilized for eqsort and sort a substantial quantity of arrays, analyzing the average time for varying data sizes \cite{no}. The compared methods are selected as follows:\\
